  "goodToKnow": "Die Mundart is a dialect, a slightly more traditional word than der Dialekt: in Mundart sprechen, Mundartdichtung (dialect poetry). German has many dialects: Bairisch, Schwäbisch, Sächsisch, Kölsch, Plattdeutsch and Swiss German, some barely understandable to other Germans. Dialect use is strongest in the south and in Switzerland. Hochdeutsch is standard German. Plural: die Mundarten."
